- **MetricsTracker**: Tracks processed bytes for monitoring performance.
- **Scalability**: The pipeline can be scaled horizontally by adding more streams or processing nodes.

This implementation provides a robust foundation for building a scalable data processing pipeline in Node.js. Adjust parameters and error handling as needed to fit your specific use case."]

