['Below is a C function to manage a dynamic linked list of `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T` structures, addressing the specified requirements:

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <pthread.h>

typedef struct {
    int RNTI;
    // Other fields...
} RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG;

typedef struct {
    int CRCFLAG;
    // Other fields...
} CRC_INDICATION_REL8_TAG;

